  m_text: 'Your safety is our responsibility, but luckily our responsibility was
    waived by your actions. Unfortunately, we had already placed a <b>sword</b> inside
    for your futile defense against the <i>Minotaur</i>. To ensure everyone receives
    a miserable experience, please find the <b>coin fragments</b> and assemble the
    <b>coin</b> to complete your celebrity meet with the <i>Minotaur</i>. '
